cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MahjongAI-Sanma-Training"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
abstract: >-
  A reproducible training workflow for three-player Japanese mahjong (sanma) AI, built as a
  modified work tree on top of Mortal. It covers three-player rules and observation encoding,
  a Tenhou game-log pipeline, GRP and offline training, online self-play phases, and
  statistically grounded evaluation panels, driven by one variant profile.
authors:
